  "user_impact": "Audio that starts on its own drowns out screen reader speech.",
  "technical_impact": "<audio autoplay> without muted; whether it plays longer than three seconds and can be paused is not in the markup.",
  "source": "WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.2 Audio Control; HTML §4.8.11 autoplay/muted",
  "applicability": "Every <audio> not hidden by the hidden attribute (an <audio> without controls is display:none by UA style and still plays).",
  "expectation": "<audio autoplay> without muted starts sound on load. Whether it lasts more\nthan three seconds or can be paused is not in the markup: REVIEW at the audio.\nmuted autoplay and audio without autoplay pass.",
